Package: linux-firmware-iceland
Version: 7.2.0-sm8850-1
Architecture: arm64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: iceland mainline <iceland@localhost>
Description: Firmware, DTB and initramfs configuration for OnePlus Pad 4 (SM8850)
 The iceland device firmware tree (ath12k, qca, qcom, novatek) and the
 kaanapali-oneplus-iceland DTB.
 .
 Registers the initial initramfs-tools configuration for the device:
 /etc/initramfs-tools/conf.d/iceland (MODULES=list, zstd) plus the
 /etc/initramfs-tools/hooks/iceland hook carrying the curated boot
 module set (generated from the kernel metarepo initrd-modules.txt).
 Also ships /etc/kernel/postinst.d/zz-iceland-flash-initrd, which
 flashes every regenerated initramfs to the GPT initrd partition with
 the BootApp size prefix.  postinst flashes the DTB to the GPT dtb
 partition.
